@startuml seq_ingestion
title RAG Ingestion Flow — diagram sekwencji (event-driven)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5

actor Admin
participant "Ingestion API" as Ing
database "MongoDB" as Mongo
participant "/tmp/uploads\n(shared volume)" as TMP
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Parser" as Parser
participant "Chunking" as Chunk
participant "Embedding" as Emb
participant "Indexing" as Idx
database "Weaviate" as Weav

== Upload ==
Admin -> Ing: POST /projects/{id}/documents\n(multipart PDF)
Ing -> TMP: zapis pliku\n/tmp/uploads/{uuid}.pdf
Ing -> Mongo: insert document\nstatus=uploaded
Ing ->> MQ: document.uploaded\n{document_id, tmp_path, project_id}
Ing --> Admin: 202 Accepted\n{document_id}

== Parsing ==
MQ ->> Parser: consume document.uploaded
Parser -> TMP: read /tmp/uploads/{uuid}.pdf
Parser -> Parser: ekstrakcja tekstu\n(pypdf / docling)
Parser -> Mongo: update extracted_text\nstatus=parsed
Parser -> TMP: usuń plik (cleanup)
Parser ->> MQ: document.parsed\n{document_id}

== Chunking ==
MQ ->> Chunk: consume document.parsed
Chunk -> Mongo: read extracted_text\nread project.settings.chunking
Chunk -> Chunk: podziel tekst\n(strategia z settings)
Chunk -> Mongo: insert chunks[]\nstatus=chunked
Chunk ->> MQ: document.chunked\n{document_id, chunk_ids[]}

== Embedding ==
MQ ->> Emb: consume document.chunked
Emb -> Mongo: read chunks (batch)
Emb -> Emb: generuj embeddingi\n(batch processing)
Emb ->> MQ: chunks.embedded\n{[{chunk_id, vector}]}

== Indexing ==
MQ ->> Idx: consume chunks.embedded
Idx -> Weav: insert vectors + properties\n(document_id, chunk_index,\nproject_id, content, page)
Idx -> Mongo: status=indexed\nupdate stats

note over Admin, Weav
  W każdym kroku: status_history dopisywany w MongoDB
  z trace_id (z nagłówka X-Trace-Id w eventach AMQP).
  W razie błędu: status=failed + error message.
end note

@enduml
